# Chapter 0, the cold open "23:41" (docs/DESIGN.md §3.5; data/chapters.json chapter 0, opening "cold_open").
# V2-27. The cour Pasteur steps at night under Toma's fairy lights, before anything is explained:
# three shots (world.json cold_wide, cold_hand, cold_face): a wide of the eight on the steps against the lights, a
# close one of Mano holding out his one AirPod ("Want one?"), his face lit by his phone; then the picture freezes,
# "Okay. How did I get here?", black, "Six hours earlier.", and chapter 1's card, the dream and the wake-up.
# Who the AirPod is held out to is never shown here: that is the last choice of chapter 5. A chapter-select replay
# of chapter 1 skips all of this (main.begin_chapter).

~ c0.open
$ shot cold_wide
$ wait 3.2
$ shot cold_hand
$ wait 0.8
mano: Want one?
$ shot cold_face
$ wait 1.6
$ freeze
think: Okay. How did I get here?
$ set cold_open_seen
$ caption "Six hours earlier." 2.6
$ chapter 1
